   "class_definition": "All natural persons in the United States who used any website, app, or service made available by or through GoodRx at any time prior to April 20, 2024. Excludes Defendants and their affiliates, opt-outs, Meta and Google, and the judges and their clerks. The complaint's class (¶219) was nationwide GoodRx users whose communications or data were shared with third parties, plus CA, NY, FL and IL state classes.",
